/E (Justification: Hard plastic\(exam board\) was selected as the primary structural material due to its optimal balance of strength-to-weight ratio and cost. It is easy to cut, drill, and machine using standard hand tools. Furthermore, plastic acts as an excellent electrical insulator, mitigating the risk of short-circuiting the exposed Arduino or motor driver connections. It also provides enough flex to absorb minor impact shocks without permanently deforming.)
